			"description": "Trukk",
			"local_notes": "ST/HP 83; Hnd/SR +0/3; HT 9f; Move 3/30; LWt. 6; Load 1.5; SM +4; Occ. 2+12; DR 125/125 (front 125, side 125, rear 125, top 0, under 125); Locations O4WX. Control: Driving (Heavy Wheeled).\n\nOpen-topped: the boyz ride in an open bed [O], hit instead of the truck and unprotected by its armour; no roof (top DR 0). A big shoota on a pintle [X]. Ramshackle: HT 9.\n\nLore: A bolted-together wagon of scrap plate, a roaring engine and a flatbed for a mob of boyz, built by Meks from whatever was to hand and driven flat out at the enemy. AV10 all round, open-topped, fast.\n\nDesign: HP 4 x cube root of the curb weight (loaded weight less Load, B463: 9,000 lb) = 83 (a soft-skinned truck, not doubled). DR 125 (AV10) front, sides and rear; no roof. About 6 m long (6.6 yd): SM +3, +1 for the box: +4. Move 3/30, a light, overpowered truck. Hnd/SR 0/3 from the Basic Set's jeep and pickup. HT 9 for the Orks' build quality.",
